[over.match.oper]/3, [over.match.best]/2, [temp.inst]/2: a non-member
non-template operator<< that perfectly matches is preferred over a member
operator<< template, and forming that member-template candidate must not
instantiate its (here ill-formed) body.  Reduced from the message.h dog-food
"operator 'shl' not defined" noise.  Non-vacuous.
